  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw2200.html",
  "prefLabel": "Env-Sw 2202.04 Recordkeeping",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Sw 2202.04 Recordkeeping.\n\n(a) A disposal facility shall maintain the following records for at least 5 years from the date the record was produced:\n\n(1) Accurate and complete records detailing the type and quantity of solid waste disposed during each calendar quarter; and\n\n(2) A copy of all records used to calculate each quarterly surcharge payment, including waste receipts.\n\n(b) A disposal facility shall provide copies of all records specified in (a) above to the department within 15 days of request.\n\nSource. #14422, INTERIM, eff 1-1-26; ss by #14633, eff 7-1-26, EXPIRES: 7-1-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-sw2200.html"
